#: CHANGELOG.md:8
msgid "The MPV adapter starts on a worker, and the one-copy guard is per user (#54)"
msgstr "MPV 适配器在工作线程上启动，单副本防护按用户生效 (#54)"

#: CHANGELOG.md:20
msgid "The built-in player's cues must reach the speech manager, and six more audit findings (#52)"
msgstr "内置播放器的提示必须到达语音管理器，以及再六项审计发现 (#52)"

#: CHANGELOG.md:14
msgid "The recording relay needs a token, the Stalker MAC is masked, and a country code is only a country when it is written like one (#53)"
msgstr "录制中继需要令牌，Stalker MAC 已被掩码，国家代码只有以代码形式书写时才算国家 (#53)"

